Numerators of the characteristic polynomials of the von Mangoldt function matrix.

The 55 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A260237

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [0, 1, -1, -1, -1, 1, 1, 11, -1, -1,
    0, -3, -9, 5, 1, 0, 3, 81, 7, -73,
    -1, 0, 3, 73, -1261, -1183, 53, 1, 0, -3,
    -1231, 5251, 8989, 1451, -731, -1, 0, 0, 7, 397,
